{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 WONDER LIBRARY : PROLOGUE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wonder Library: Prologue</i></strong> is the first chapter of a narrative adventure that journeys through the realms of emotion, memory, and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A child who has lost their memories awakens in a strange place and steps through a glowing door, arriving on an island where a mysterious library awaits.<br>There, they meet <i>Yuna</i>, a warm-hearted guide who leads them to open a book\u2014unfolding another world and beginning their journey to recover forgotten memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the hidden stories within picture books and the gentle missions scattered across the island, and slowly rediscover emotions and memories you once forgot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island and its mysterious library as you recover lost memories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062240/extras/703edddd7ca3fffade80d9153b5e8431.poster.avif?t=1760405651\" width=500 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062240/extras/703edddd7ca3fffade80d9153b5e8431.webm?t=1760405651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062240/extras/703edddd7ca3fffade80d9153b5e8431.mp4?t=1760405651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the island\u2019s secrets with the gentle guidance of Yuna.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor